@baseUrl = https://BACKEND-PRIVAT/api
@adminToken = ISI_DI_LOKAL_JANGAN_COMMIT_TOKEN_ASLI
@siswaId = 1

### Preview lokal: admin, tanpa Gemini dan tanpa menulis draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/siswa/{{siswaId}}/rekomendasi-beasiswa/preview?target_jenjang=SMA
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Generate: memakai ranking lokal, lalu penjelasan Gemini dan draft pending
POST {{baseUrl}}/siswa/{{siswaId}}/rekomendasi-beasiswa/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{"target_jenjang":"SMA"}
